  "decomposition": "```json\n{\n  \"steps\": [\n    {\n      \"step_id\": \"s1\",\n      \"description\": \"Access the certificate data from cert.csv as a table.\",\n      \"intent\": \"other\",\n      \"control_flow\": \"linear\",\n      \"zone\": \"linear\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"step_id\": \"s2\",\n      \"description\": \"Get the first row from the certificate table.\",\n      \"intent\": \"other\",\n      \"control_flow\": \"linear\",\n      \"zone\": \"linear\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"step_id\": \"s3\",\n      \"description\": \"Extract the owner's email address from the current row.\",\n      \"intent\": \"get_cell\",\n      \"control_flow\": \"linear\",\n      \"zone\": \"linear\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"step_id\": \"s4\",\n      \"description\": \"Extract the certificate details from the current row.\",\n      \"intent\": \"get_cell\",\n      \"control_flow\": \"linear\",\n      \"zone\": \"linear\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"step_id\": \"s5\",\n      \"description\": \"Send an email to the owner with their certificate details.\",\n      \"intent\": \"send_email\",\n      \"control_flow\": \"linear\",\n      \"zone\": \"linear\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"variable_contract\": {\n    \"variables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"certTable\",\n        \"type\": \"table\",\n        \"source\": \"external — must exist before workflow runs (from cert.csv)\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"getCellValue1\",\n        \"type\": \"string\",\n        \"source\": \"owner email from certTable\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"getCellValue2\",\n        \"type\": \"string\",\n        \"source\": \"certificate details from certTable\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"loop_type\": \"none\",\n    \"loop_source\": null\n  },\n  \"complexity\": \"simple\",\n  \"estimated_activity_count\": 6\n}\n```",
